dist/
node_modules/
*.tgz
.wiki-build/

# Doctor / registry output. Regenerated by `pnpm sdk-doctor` and the debug-graph CLIs;
# the canonical mechanics map lives at the repo root, not here.
docs/mechanics-map/
.wiki-build/

# The raw patch-notes archive fetched from Discord.
#
# A working artifact, not a deliverable: it carries message and author ids, and it is thousands
# of messages of Discord JSON. What ships is the DERIVED dataset generated from it.
data/patch-notes/raw-messages.json

# Artwork catalogues.
#
# `assets:manifest` and `assets:game` read a directory of the game's art and write a list of its
# filenames. Useful against a private copy; not ours to distribute. A catalogue naming every
# sprite in the game is derived from the game whoever typed it, so it stays out of the repo and
# out of the package — `src/assets/index.ts` ships the naming RULE instead.
src/assets/*.generated.ts

# WASM build artifacts: the Javy compiler is fetched on demand, and the module is built from dist.
wasm/.tools/
wasm/.build/
